From: Javier Tia <javier@peridio.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:50:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: aquantia: attach the AQR113C wake hooks to the
 AQR113C entry

The NVIDIA wake-on-boot change for the AQR113C (aqr113c_get_wol and
aqr113c_set_wol) registers its hooks in the phy_driver table. In this tree
the two lines sit in the AQR111B0 entry, and the AQR113C entry has none.
The table gained entries after the change was written, so its last hunk
now lands in the neighbouring entry.

The effect is on the 10G port of the Jetson AGX Orin carriers, whose PHY
matches PHY_ID_AQR113C. phydev->drv->get_wol is NULL there,
phy_ethtool_get_wol() leaves wolinfo.supported at 0, and nvethernet's
ether_get_wol() copies that out, so ethtool prints "Supports Wake-on: d"
and ethtool -s <port> wol g is refused. aqr113c_get_wol() sets
supported = WAKE_MAGIC unconditionally, so the only missing piece is the
table entry.

Move the two lines into the AQR113C entry. The AQR111B0 PHY has no use for
the AQR113C-specific register sequence, so it loses them.

The wake sequence itself is unchanged. It matches the one NVIDIA's R39
kernel (a 6.8 tree) carries in its AQR113C entry, where ethtool reports
"Supports Wake-on: g" on the same board.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [fixes up NVIDIA's out-of-tree Tegra series]
Signed-off-by: Javier Tia <javier@peridio.com>
---
 drivers/net/phy/aquantia/aquantia_main.c | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/phy/aquantia/aquantia_main.c b/drivers/net/phy/aquantia/aquantia_main.c
--- a/drivers/net/phy/aquantia/aquantia_main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/aquantia/aquantia_main.c
@@ -1662,8 +1662,6 @@
 	.led_polarity_set = aqr_phy_led_polarity_set,
 	.inband_caps	= aqr_gen2_inband_caps,
 	.config_inband	= aqr_gen2_config_inband,
-	.get_wol	= &aqr113c_get_wol,
-	.set_wol	= &aqr113c_set_wol,
 },
 {
 	PHY_ID_MATCH_MODEL(PHY_ID_AQR405),
@@ -1794,6 +1792,8 @@
 	.led_polarity_set = aqr_phy_led_polarity_set,
 	.inband_caps    = aqr_gen2_inband_caps,
 	.config_inband  = aqr_gen2_config_inband,
+	.get_wol	= &aqr113c_get_wol,
+	.set_wol	= &aqr113c_set_wol,
 },
 {
 	PHY_ID_MATCH_MODEL(PHY_ID_AQR114C),
-- 
2.43.0
